	{0x0592a, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0.383540362, 0.616459608, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play Q then A then low to K", "Lead the Q from North and play low from South. If West plays the J or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead the A from North to the 9 in South. Then lead low from North. If East plays the J or low, play the K from South; if East shows out, play the 10 from South. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 62%, 3 tricks 100%.", 1341, 10},
	{0x05949, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0, 0.128571436, 0.871428549, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to K then J then Q", "Lead low from North to the K in South. If West plays the 10 or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead the J from North to the 9 in South. If West plays the 10 or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead the Q from North (South has none). If West shows out, lead the A from North next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 5 tricks 87%, 4 tricks 100%.", 1351, 9},
