	{0x0a492, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0.705279529, 0.294720501, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to 10", "Lead low from North. If East plays the Q, 9 or low, play the A from South; if East shows out, play low from South. If West plays the Q or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays the 9 or low, or shows out, play the 10 from North; if West plays the Q, play the K from North. If East plays the Q or shows out, lead low from North next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 29%, 3 tricks 100%.", 5243, 11},
	{0x0a49a, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0.471739143, 0.528260887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to low", "Lead low from North to the A in South. If West plays the Q or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays low or shows out, play low from North; if West plays the Q, play the K from North. If East plays the Q, lead the 10 from North next. If East shows out, lead the 9 from South next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 53%, 3 tricks 100%.", 5254, 9},
