	{0x0e440, 0, {0, 0, 0.281366467, 0.452173918, 0.266459614, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then duck then K", "Lead low from North to the A in South. Then lead low from North (South has none). If West plays the Q, lead the J from North next. If West shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead the K from North (South has none). If West plays the Q, lead the J from North next. Then play the rest out. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 27%, 3 tricks 72%, 2 tricks 100%.", 9124, 14},
	{0x0e446, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0, 0.123913042, 0.638695657, 0.237391308, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to J", "Lead low from North. If East plays the Q, 10 or low, play the A from South; if East shows out, play low from South. If West plays the Q, lead the J from North next. If West plays the 10, lead the K from North next. If West shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays the 10 or low, play the J from North; if West plays the Q, play the K from North; if West shows out, play low from North. If East shows out, lead low from North next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 6 tricks 24%, 5 tricks 88%, 4 tricks 100%.", 9138, 9},
