	{0x0e44a, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0.123913042, 0.508695662, 0.367391318, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to J", "Lead low from North. If East plays the Q, 10 or low, play the A from South; if East shows out, play low from South. If West plays the Q, lead the J from North next. If West shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays the 10 or low, play the J from North; if West plays the Q, play the K from North; if West shows out, play low from North. If East shows out, lead low from North next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 5 tricks 37%, 4 tricks 88%, 3 tricks 100%.", 9158, 10},
