	{0x11086, 0, {0, 0, 0.0391304344, 0.226086959, 0.734782636, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to J then low to low", "Lead low from North. If East plays the 10 or low, play the J from South; if East plays the K or Q, or shows out, play low from South. Then lead low from North and play low from South. If West shows out, lead low from North next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 73%, 3 tricks 96%, 2 tricks 100%.", 10885, 8},
