	{0x110a2, 0, {0, 0.0195652172, 0.18913044, 0.519999981, 0.271304339, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Run the 10 then low to J", "Lead the 10 from South. If West plays the 9 or low, or shows out, play low from North; if West plays the K or Q, play the A from North. If East plays the K or Q, lead the A from North next. Then lead low from North. If East plays low, play the J from South; if East plays the K or Q, or shows out, play low from South. If West shows out, lead low from North next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 27%, 3 tricks 79%, 2 tricks 98%, 1 trick 100%.", 10911, 10},
