	{0x2a498, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0.471739143, 0.528260887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to 10", "Lead low from North to the A in South. If West plays the Q or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays low or shows out, play the 10 from North; if West plays the Q, play the K from North. If East plays the Q, lead low from North next. If East shows out, lead the 9 from South next. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 53%, 3 tricks 100%.", 21220, 9},
	{0x2a4a1, 0, {0, 0, 0, 0.471739143, 0.528260887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play K then low to 10 then low to A", "Lead the K from North and play low from South. Then lead low from North. If East plays the 9 or low, or shows out, play the 10 from South; if East plays the Q, play the A from South. Then lead low from North to the A in South. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 53%, 3 tricks 100%.", 21229, 9},
