	{0x2e121, 2, {0, 0, 0.0956521705, 0.373043478, 0.531304359, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to low then low to 10", "Lead low from North. If East plays the K, J, 9 or low, play the A from South; if East shows out, play low from South. If West plays the K, lead the 10 from South next. If West plays the J or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays the K or low, or shows out, play low from North; if West plays the J, play the Q from North. If East plays the K, lead the Q from North next. If East shows out, lead the 10 from South next. Then lead low from North to the 10 in South. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 53%, 3 tricks 90%, 2 tricks 100%.", 25133, 10},
