	{0x2e124, 0, {0, 0, 0.0195652172, 0.307826102, 0.672608674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to A then low to 9 then low to 10", "Lead low from North to the A in South. If West plays the K, lead the Q from North next. If West plays the J or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays low or shows out, play the 9 from North; if West plays the K, play low from North; if West plays the J, play the Q from North. If East plays the K, lead the Q from North next. If East shows out, lead the 10 from South next. Then lead low from North to the 10 in South. Then cash your winners. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 67%, 3 tricks 98%, 2 tricks 100%.", 25153, 9},
