	{0x48605, 0, {0, 0.0195652172, 0.104347825, 0.717826068, 0.158260867, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0}, "Play low to Q then low to K", "Lead low from North. If East plays the J, 10 or low, play the Q from South; if East plays the A or shows out, play low from South. If West plays the A or shows out, lead low from North next. Then lead low from South. If West plays the J or 10, play the K from North; if West plays the A or shows out, play low from North. Then play the rest out. Chances vs best defence, at least: 4 tricks 16%, 3 tricks 88%, 2 tricks 98%, 1 trick 100%.", 28900, 10},
